 "full-medium": {
  "text": "First B Prague is live. Patek To on Casper testnet. The first B Prague verifiable program with real execution and real sediment. This is really interesting. So virtual programs, verifiable programs on the L1. Anybody can build on it. That's like really like I think it's really, really bullish for Casper. Make anything you want. And it's on it's on a proof of work. I think the days are going to come back, right? Because Casper is going to get more popular right now. V Prague is going to be coming out to verifiable programs and making apps on Casper and on the L1. And yeah, it's just going to be a more and more usable chain that can do anything, if not more than all the other chains. Right. And then as this bull run just keeps picking up, you know, the steam keeps it gets hotter and hotter. There's going to be more and more buy in. And I think eventually all these Casper tokens, you know, whatever you want to call them now, KRC 20s, they're going to become hot, too. It's pretty good news for the long term for Casper.",
